{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ad8d68ea34b1fd68","name":"Stun Cloak","source":{"id":"source:reference-ad8d68ea34b1fd68","title":"Stun Cloak","revision":20961,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:53:03Z","sha256":"42548a7bf63bbe6ef5a1af739c94148d8a02941a39560afa6acfcbca06731744","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20961","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Stun%20Cloak&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ad8d68ea34b1fd68","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Galaxy at War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Galaxy_at_War"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["This cloak is a weapon as much as a form of protection. Lined with microfilaments attached to a power cell, the Stun Cloak can emit a powerful electric shock to any character who ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapples"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapples"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabs"},", or is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappled"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"},", by the wearer. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Officers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officers"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nobles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nobles"}," wear Stun Cloaks to thwart kidnapping attempts, and commandos who expect to engage in close combat also wear them. The interior of the cloak is insulated to prevent accidental shocks to the wearer.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the wearer successfully makes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grapple"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grapple","referenceId":"reference:4c93c2c050c768ed"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grab"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grab","referenceId":"reference:7d935f258918d1a5"}," attack, or is successfully ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grappled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grappled"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Grabbed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Grabbed"}," by an enemy, the Stun Cloak deals 3d8 points of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage. By doubling the price (from 3,500 to 7,000), the Stun Cloak can be upgraded to include the same capabilities as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["All-Temperature Cloak"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/All-Temperature_Cloak","referenceId":"reference:5ba3a59c90c22431"}," or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Camouflage Poncho"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Camouflage_Poncho","referenceId":"reference:3d7f9f91cfcaa7b8"},". Otherwise, the Stun Cloak cannot be upgraded with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor Upgrades"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor_Upgrades"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Armor","referenceId":"reference:1b329ddc8a34adfe"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 3,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},":"]}," +1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," Bonus:"]}," +5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
